clauditor — NOTICE
==================

clauditor studies and, where licenses permit, adapts techniques from the
following projects. Per the project rule (SPEC.md §3): code is ported only
from MIT/Apache-2.0/BSD sources with attribution here; from anything else,
ideas only, re-expressed from scratch.

1. tmux-claude-session-manager
   https://github.com/craftzdog/tmux-claude-session-manager
   License: MIT — Copyright (c) 2026 Takuya Matsuyama
   Adapted: the pid-subtree↔pane correlation approach for mapping
   supervisor sessions to tmux panes; the attention-first ordering policy
   (waiting > idle > unknown > busy); use of `tmux capture-pane -e -p`
   for ANSI-preserving previews.
   All adapted logic re-implemented in Go; no shell code copied verbatim.

2. dmux
   https://github.com/formkit/dmux
   License: MIT — Copyright (c) 2025 Justin Schroeder
   Adapted: worktree lifecycle conventions (branch slug naming, worktree
   directory placement) informing clauditor's `newWorktree` dispatch.
   Re-implemented in Go.

3. agent-deck
   https://github.com/asheshgoplani/agent-deck
   License: MIT — Copyright (c) 2025 Ashesh Goplani
   Studied for information architecture (grouping, needs-attention
   surfacing) and remote-control protocol design. No code ported.

4. claude-tmux
   https://github.com/nielsgroen/claude-tmux
   License: AGPL-3.0-only — Copyright (C) 2026 Niels Groeneveld
   IDEAS ONLY — no code, comments, identifiers, regexes, or format strings
   ported (AGPL is outside this project's port allowlist). Cited as prior
   art for: pane-id-as-canonical-handle, git-context-driven action gating,
   tolerant tab-separated tmux format parsing.
